  "SampleLabel": {
   "additionalProperties": false,
   "description": "公共样例的出处标签（只出现在样例里；真实运行的消息不写）。\n\n* ``offline_run``：由离线闭环实际执行产生；\n* ``controlled_fixture``：受控测试夹具（例如写好的计划、注入的事件、构造的资料缺口），标明来源；\n* ``contract_example``：线上服务（幂等提交、查询、断线恢复）尚未实现，这里只是**标明为示例**的契约响应。",
   "properties": {
    "note": {
     "maxLength": 600,
     "minLength": 1,
     "title": "Note",
     "type": "string"
    },
    "origin": {
     "enum": [
      "offline_run",
      "controlled_fixture",
      "contract_example"
     ],
     "title": "Origin",
     "type": "string"
    },
    "produced_by": {
     "maxLength": 300,
     "minLength": 1,
     "title": "Produced By",
     "type": "string"
    },
    "synthetic": {
     "const": true,
     "default": true,
     "title": "Synthetic",
     "type": "boolean"
    }
   },
   "required": [
    "origin",
    "produced_by",
    "note"
   ],
   "title": "SampleLabel",
   "type": "object"
  },
